# --- Role definitions (for reference — implemented via stored tuples) ---
# Role: operator
#   description: Monitors real-time dashboards and sensor readings. Can acknowledge alerts and escalate issues. Cannot modify device configurations.

# Role: maintenance_tech
#   description: Executes maintenance work orders. Can update order status, log findings, and record parts used. Cannot approve high-cost orders.

# Role: engineer
#   description: Configures sensors and devices. Can calibrate sensors, set alert thresholds, commission/decommission devices. Has read access to all telemetry at assigned facilities.

# Role: facility_manager
#   description: Full operational authority over their facility. Can approve maintenance orders, manage personnel assignments, and configure facility-level policies.

# Role: admin
#   description: Platform-wide administrative access. Can manage facilities, configure system-level policies, and access cross-facility analytics.

